<%- include('partials/head') %>
<%- include('partials/header') %>
<article class="section">
  <div class="wrap prose legal">
    <p class="legal-note">We keep our policies short and in plain language. If anything is unclear, write to us and we will help.</p>
    <% if (kind === 'privacy') { %>
    <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
    <h1 class="h2">Privacy notice</h1>
    <p>Goforge Digital (“we”) is run by <%= BRAND.founder %>, <%= BRAND.founderRole %>, from <%= BRAND.address.line1 %>, <%= BRAND.address.line2 %>, <%= BRAND.address.region %>, India. Goforge Digital is an MSME (Udyam) registered business. Grievance officer: <%= BRAND.founder %>, <%= s.email %>.</p>
    <h2 class="h3">What we collect, and why</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Project form: your name, phone, business name and message, so we can reply about a project.</li>
      <li>Internship form: your name, college, course and year, phone number, programme and note, so we can consider an application and reply.</li>
      <li>If you later pay a fee or a deposit: the payment reference your bank or UPI app shows us. We do not store card numbers on this website.</li>
      <li>Technical logs of the site (such as IP address) for security and rate limits, kept with the hosting provider.</li>
      <li>Analytics, only if it has been switched on: which pages were opened. It is off until an analytics ID is set in the server environment.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We do not sell this information. We do not use it for ads about other companies.</p>
    <h2 class="h3">Who else sees it</h2>
    <p>The studio, and the host that stores the database.</p>
    <h2 class="h3">How long we keep it</h2>
    <p>Enquiries and applications are kept for 24 months after your last message, or sooner if you ask us to delete them, unless we have to keep a record for a legal claim or a payment.</p>
    <h2 class="h3">Your choices</h2>
    <p>You can ask for a copy, a correction, or deletion, and you can withdraw consent for us to keep using the details to contact you. Email <%= s.email %> or write to the address above. We aim to answer within 30 days. If you are not satisfied, you can complain to the Data Protection Board of India once that route is open to you.</p>
    <p>This programme is designed for college students aged 18 and above.</p>
    <h2 class="h3">Grievance contact</h2>
    <p><%= BRAND.founder %>, <%= BRAND.founderRole %>, <%= s.email %>, <%= s.phone1 %>.</p>
    <% } else if (kind === 'terms') { %>
    <p class="eyebrow">Terms</p>
    <h1 class="h2">Terms of use</h1>
    <p>The site goforgedigital.com describes the studio’s services and internship. It explains what we offer and how to get started.</p>
    <h2 class="h3">Client software/service projects</h2>
    <p>Client work starts only after you accept a written scope and a price. The free website check is a complimentary review with recommendations. Who owns the finished work is written in that scope. Until a scope says otherwise, you own the code and design once the project is paid in full, and we may show it in our portfolio only with your permission.</p>
    <h2 class="h3">Training and internship</h2>
    <p>Training and the internship are two stages, covered by one training fee: assignments, projects and the internship are included with no extra charges. The fee and dates are confirmed on a call. Your seat is confirmed on enrolment. Our training certificate and internship letter are accepted by colleges and recognised by industry, and we can provide college-specific formats on request.</p>
    <h2 class="h3">The site</h2>
    <p>Please use the forms for genuine enquiries and share only your own details. The law of India applies. Courts at in Faridabad, Haryana have jurisdiction.</p>
    <% } else { %>
    <p class="eyebrow">Refunds</p>
    <h1 class="h2">Refunds</h1>
    <p>Our refund terms are designed to be fair and simple.</p>
    <h2 class="h3">Free offers</h2>
    <p>The demo class and the website check have no fee, so there is nothing to refund.</p>
    <h2 class="h3">Student training fee</h2>
    <p><strong>Projects and internship included — no extra fees.</strong> Students pay only the training fee. Assignments, projects and the internship are included, with no extra charges.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>If Goforge Digital cancels a batch before it starts, fees already paid for that batch are refunded in full.</li>
      <li>Cancel before your first live session and you receive a full refund of the fee paid.</li>
      <li>Cancel within 7 days of your first live session and you receive a 50% refund. After 7 days, the fee is non-refundable, and you may move to a later batch once at no extra cost.</li>
      <li>The internship letter is included at no extra charge and is issued when the internship work is completed.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2 class="h3">Client software/service projects</h2>
    <p>This applies to client software and service work only, not to students. Client projects usually start with a 50% advance. The advance is fully refundable until work begins. Once work has started, you pay only for the work completed, and any balance of the advance is refunded.</p>
    <p>Ask for a refund by email at <%= s.email %>, with the name used on the payment. We reply within 7 working days, and approved refunds reach your original payment method within 7–10 working days.</p>
    <% } %>
    <p class="legal-links"><a href="/privacy">Privacy</a> · <a href="/terms">Terms</a> · <a href="/refund">Refunds</a></p>
  </div>
</article>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
